{# ------------------------------------------------------------- Shift -- #}
<section class="wShift">
  <div class="sectionTop">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Year one</p>
      <h2>Where we started, where we are.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wShift__grid">
    <div class="wShift__col">
      <p class="wShift__label">July 2025</p>
      <ul class="wShift__list">
        <li>Capability screens in a slide deck — nothing a customer could click through live</li>
        <li>A fragmented product across separate systems, with outside help owning the design</li>
        <li>One piece ran as its own app, maintained by hand every day</li>
        <li>Prototypes had quietly become permanent features, with no system behind them</li>
        <li>No shared components, no Storybook, no dark mode</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wShift__col wShift__col--now">
      <p class="wShift__label">October 2026</p>
      <ul class="wShift__list">
        <li>Live demos anywhere — the team builds on the features sales is actually selling</li>
        <li>Design led in-house; the outside agency dependency is gone</li>
        <li>One codebase. The old separate app's capabilities live in the core product</li>
        <li>AI builds and explains dashboards on its own, including for agents</li>
        <li>A design system running from source files to ~1,000 coded component stories</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wShift__quotes">
    <blockquote class="wShift__quote">
